---
interface Props {
  locale: "en" | "pt";
  standalone?: boolean;
}
const { locale, standalone = false } = Astro.props;
const Heading = standalone ? "h1" : "h2";
---

{locale === "pt" ? (
  <section id="about" class="shell section about-summary">
    <div>
      <Heading>Sobre mim</Heading>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>
        No trabalho, desenvolvo aplicações empresariais com Java e Spring Boot.
        Procuro entender os compromissos de cada decisão e manter a arquitetura
        simples o suficiente para que o software possa evoluir.
      </p>
      <p>
        Nos projetos pessoais e acadêmicos, exploro novas ferramentas e
        abordagens. Uso esses projetos para investigar problemas além das
        demandas do dia a dia. Tenho inglês C1.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/erick-murakami">
        LinkedIn ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
) : (
  <section id="about" class="shell section about-summary">
    <div>
      <Heading>About me</Heading>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>
        In my professional work, I develop enterprise applications with Java and
        Spring Boot. I care about understanding trade-offs and keeping
        architecture simple enough for the software to evolve.
      </p>
      <p>
        Personal and academic projects give me room to explore new tools and
        approaches beyond day-to-day requirements. My English proficiency is C1.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/erick-murakami">
        LinkedIn ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
)}
